## 10. Audit conclusion

Fractal Cell Runtime Integration v0.1 passes technical audit for the committed runtime-facing implementation. The layer is a bounded integration adapter that composes existing Fractal DAG executor behavior with bounded actor contracts and existing Post V&V / GT boundaries. It preserves parent Root final authority, blocks child target-boundary escapes, fails closed when Post V&V fallback is used, and keeps all final-output, action, authority, bypass, mutation, network, Gemini, and connector counters at zero.
